{
  "total": 83.05,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "You Didn't Know Credit Cards Make Money Even When You Pay on Time.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.96,
      "dur": 3.96
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "What if I told you that your credit card company can make money from you… even if you never pay a single cent in interest?",
      "start": 5.22,
      "end": 12.56,
      "dur": 7.34
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "Sounds strange, right?",
      "start": 13.82,
      "end": 14.6,
      "dur": 0.78
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "Most people think credit card companies only make money when customers are in debt.",
      "start": 15.36,
      "end": 20.5,
      "dur": 5.14
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "But that's not the whole story.",
      "start": 21.24,
      "end": 22.8,
      "dur": 1.56
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "Imagine you walk into a store and buy a $100 pair of shoes using your credit card.",
      "start": 23.7,
      "end": 29.34,
      "dur": 5.64
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "You pay $100.",
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 31.42,
      "dur": 1.42
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "But the store might receive slightly less than that.",
      "start": 32.34,
      "end": 36.62,
      "dur": 4.28
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "Why?",
      "start": 37.0,
      "end": 37.3,
      "dur": 0.3
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "Because businesses pay fees to process card payments.",
      "start": 38.48,
      "end": 42.16,
      "dur": 3.68
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "And part of those fees can go to the bank that issued your credit card.",
      "start": 42.72,
      "end": 47.02,
      "dur": 4.3
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "So even if you pay your entire bill on time…",
      "start": 47.88,
      "end": 51.44,
      "dur": 3.56
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "your card issuer can still earn money from your purchases.",
      "start": 52.1,
      "end": 56.1,
      "dur": 4.0
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "And here's the interesting part.",
      "start": 57.1,
      "end": 58.84,
      "dur": 1.74
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "The more you use your card, the more opportunities there are for those fees to add up.",
      "start": 58.84,
      "end": 66.26,
      "dur": 7.42
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "Of course, card issuers can also earn money from interest and other charges.",
      "start": 67.02,
      "end": 71.52,
      "dur": 4.5
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "But the surprising truth?",
      "start": 72.12,
      "end": 73.42,
      "dur": 1.3
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "They don't always need you to be in debt to make a profit.",
      "start": 74.18,
      "end": 78.14,
      "dur": 3.96
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "You didn't know that about money.",
      "start": 79.18,
      "end": 81.32,
      "dur": 2.14
    }
  ]
}